# Loading More Posts

We can implement simple pagination using query params.

```jsx
// app/posts/page.js
const page = Number(searchParams.page) || 1;
const skip = (page - 1) * PAGE_SIZE;
const posts = await prisma.post.findMany({ skip, take: PAGE_SIZE });
```

Also, we can add metadata for SEO:

```js
export const metadata = {
  title: 'Blog',
  description: 'Latest posts from our team',
};
```

We'll cover SEO in depth in Lesson 4.
